  "Muat tak?": "Does it fit?",
  "Nak apa-apa lagi?": "Do you want anything else?",
  "Nak beli anggur sikit.": "I want to buy a few grapes.",
  "Nak beli berapa?": "How many do you want to buy?",
  "Nak berapa biji?": "How many do you want?",
